  description: '1 "Melodious Maestra" monster + 2 "Melodious" monsters

    (Quick
    Effect): You can banish (until the End Phase) any number of "Melodious" monsters
    you control, then you can return up to that many face-up cards your opponent
    controls to the hand. You can only use this effect of "Flowering Etoile the Melodious
    Magnificat" once per turn. If this face-up Fusion Summoned card in its owner''s
    control leaves the field because of an opponent''s card: You can Special Summon
    1 "Melodious" monster from your Deck or Extra Deck, except "Flowering Etoile
    the Melodious Magnificat".'
